  m_text: "Welcome to the HealthBridge 3D Hospital Environment.\n\nHealthBridge (SehatSetu) is a modern healthcare initiative designed to provide dignified, accessible, and high-quality medical services to rural and urban communities alike.\n\n<color=#38BDF8><b>EXPLORATION CONTROLS:</b></color>\n\u2022  <color=#FACC15><b>[W, A, S, D]</b></color> : Move Forward, Left, Backward, Right\n\u2022  <color=#FACC15><b>[Left Shift]</b></color> : Hold to Sprint\n\u2022  <color=#FACC15><b>[Mouse]</b></color> : Look Around\n\u2022  <color=#FACC15><b>[E]</b></color> : Interact with Reception, Doctor, Pharmacy & ER\n\u2022  <color=#FACC15><b>[ESC]</b></color> : Pause Menu / Close Dialogs"
